label="面包屑"><a class="hover:text-ink" href="/">首页</a><span>/</span><a class="hover:text-ink" href="/cases">案例展示</a><span>/</span><span class="truncate text-ink">45㎡ 一居 · 阳光奶油小家</span></nav><header class="mt-6"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><span class="rounded-full bg-yolk px-3 py-1 text-[12px] font-medium text-ink">小户型</span><span class="rounded-full border border-[#F0E3BE] px-3 py-1 text-[12px] text-muted">奶油风</span></div><h1 class="mt-4 font-serif text-[2rem] font-extrabold leading-tight text-ink">45㎡ 一居 · 阳光奶油小家</h1><p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-[14px] leading-[1.9] text-muted">把 45㎡ 一间老房改造成通透明亮的奶油风小家，独立玄关、岛台厨房与客厅一体化。</p><p class="mt-4 flex items-center gap-2 text-[12px] text-muted"><span>上海 · 徐汇</span><span class="text-[#F0E3BE]">|</span><span>浏览量 <!-- -->163</span></p></header><section class="mt-8 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2"><div class="flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-sand text-[13px] text-muted md:col-span-2 aspect-[16/9]"><span class="font-en tracking-[0.18em]">QIYU · CASE</span></div></section><section class="mt-10 grid gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-[#F0E3BE] bg-cream p-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5"><div><p class="font-en text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-muted">建筑面积</p><p class="mt-1.5 font-serif text-[14px] font-semibold text-ink">45.00㎡</p></div><div><p class="font-en text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-muted">风格</p><p class="mt-1.5 font-serif text-[14px] font-semibold text-ink">奶油风</p></div><div><p class="font-en text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-muted">户型</p><p class="mt-1.5 font-serif text-[14px] font-semibold text-ink">一居室</p></div><div><p class="font-en text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-muted">设计师</p><p class="mt-1.5 font-serif text-[14px] font-semibold text-ink">—</p></div><div><p class="font-en text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-muted">参考造价</p><p class="mt-1.5 font-serif text-[14px] font-semibold text-ink">¥280/㎡ · 全案设计约 ¥280/㎡ 起</p></div></section><div class="mt-10 grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_300px]"><article class="min-w-0"><div class="space-y-4"><p class="text-[14px] leading-[2.05] text-ink/85">原始户型采光不足、收纳杂乱。改造核心：打通厨房与客厅形成 LDK 一体化，全屋以奶油白+原木为主调，定制整墙收纳柜体，主卧增加步入式衣柜。\n\n最终落地：通透感翻倍，储物量是原来的 2.5 倍，整体预算控制在 12.6 万。</p></div></article><aside class="h-fit rounded-2xl bg-[#4A3F30] p-6 lg:sticky lg:top-24"><p class="eyebrow text-yolk">GET A QUOTE</p><h3 class="mt-3 font-serif text-[18px] font-bold text-cream">喜欢这个案例？</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[13px] leading-[1.85] text-cream/70">告诉我们在哪、多大、想要什么风格 —— 栖屿为你定制同款温馨小家。</p><a class="btn-yolk mt-5 inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center rounded-full px-5 py-2.5 text-[14px] font-medium" href="/about#contact?ref_case=sunny-one-bed">预约免费咨询</a><p class="mt-3 text-center text-[11px] text-cream/50">全案设计约 ¥280/㎡ 起 · 免费量房</p></aside></div><nav class="mt-12 flex gap-4" aria-label="上下篇导航"><div class="flex-1"></div><div class="flex-1"></div></nav></div><!--$?--><template id="B:1"></template><!--/$--></main><footer class="mt-16 border-t border-[#F0E3BE] bg-cream"><div class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1200px] gap-10 px-6 py-12 md:grid-cols-[1.4fr_1fr_1fr_1fr]"><div><div class="flex items-center gap-2.5"><span class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-yolk"><span class="font-serif text-lg font-extrabold text-ink">栖</span></span><span class="leading-tight"><span class="block font-serif text-[15px] font-extrabold text-ink">栖屿设计</span><span class="block font-en text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] text-muted">QIYU DESIGN</span></span></div><p class="mt-4 max-w-xs text-[13px] leading-[1.85] text-muted">专注独居青年的温馨小家定制 —— 私宅 / 小户型 / 公寓空间一体化设计服务。</p></div><div><p class="font-en text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-muted">Quick Links</p><ul class="mt-4 space-y-2.5 text-[13px] text-ink"><li><a class="hover:text-yolk-d" href="/cases">案例展示</a></li><li><a class="hover:text-yolk-d" href="/packages">服务套餐</a></li><li><a class="hover:text-yolk-d" href="/news">新闻资讯</a></li><li><a c